13:ON - Dynamic Addition - Preset 1 (Slow)
14:ON - Dynamic Addition - Preset 2 (Fast)
15:ON - Static Addition - Preset 1
16:ON - Static Addition - Preset 2
7:ON - Fixed - Custom Preset
6:ON - Fixed - Preset 1 (Default)
5:ON - Fixed - Preset 2 (Start Screen)
1:ON - Fixed - Preset 3 (Mastermind)
17:ON - Fixed - Preset 4 (Leftwards)
18:ON - Fixed - Preset 5 (Rightwards)
8:ON - Fixed - Preset 6 (Mastermind Select)
9:ON - Fixed - Preset 7 (Mastermind Customize)
10:ON - Fixed - Preset 8 (Map Select)
2:ON - Fixed - Preset 9 (Survivor Cage)
3:ON - Fixed - Preset 10 (Samuel)
4:ON - Fixed - Preset 11 (Martin)
11:ON - Fixed - Preset 12 (Cosmetic &amp; Equipment Chests)
12:ON - Fixed - Preset 13 (Preset Editing)
</DropDownList>
